    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button id="accordion-button-1" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">What is a water wall, and how does it work?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <p>A water wall is a vertical water feature where water flows down a surface, creating a soothing and elegant effect. It uses a pump to circulate water continuously. Contact Midwest Tropical to learn more.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button id="accordion-button-2" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">How do you install a water wall in your home or office?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <p>Installing a water wall involves securing the wall feature, connecting the water pump, and ensuring proper electrical access. Our team at Midwest Tropical can assist with professional installation. Contact us today to have a discussion.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button id="accordion-button-3" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">What are the benefits of installing a water wall?
	  </span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <p>Water walls provide visual appeal, improve air quality, and create a calming atmosphere. They also serve as unique architectural accents. Feel free to reach out to us at Midwest Tropical for a personalized consultation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="accordion-item">
