    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button id="accordion-button-5" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">How do you maintain a water wall, and how often should it be cleaned?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <p>You can maintain a water wall by cleaning the surface and pump, as well as checking the water quality. It should be cleaned every few months to prevent buildup.</p>
